0.25 0.45 0.65 RG 50 766 m 545 766 l S
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 751 Tm (The supplied token-level CSV files contain approximately 38,366 training sentences and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 737 Tm (38,367 test sentences, with roughly 840,000 tokens in each large split. The TINY TEST) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 723 Tm (contains 13 deliberately ambiguous or misspelled sentences. Tokens are grouped by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 709 Tm (sentence_id; every token has a word and a BIO tag.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 690 Tm (There are 17 evaluation labels: O plus B/I variants for geo, gpe, org, per, tim, art, eve) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 676 Tm (and nat. About 83% of tokens are O, so ordinary token accuracy would be misleading. Rare) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 662 Tm (labels such as natural phenomena, events and artefacts occur only a few hundred times.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 648 Tm (Sentence-length inspection motivates a maximum sequence length of 60 for the recurrent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 634 Tm (models. The train/test vocabulary mismatch also motivates pretrained and subword) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 620 Tm (representations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.35 g 1 0 0 1 278 25 Tm (4 / 10) Tj ET

endstream
endobj
