BT /F2 19 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 785 Tm (5. Methodology) Tj ET
0.25 0.45 0.65 RG 50 766 m 545 766 l S
BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 751 Tm (5.1 Conditional random fields) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 725 Tm (Three linear-chain CRFs were implemented with sklearn-crfsuite. Version 1 uses lowercase,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 711 Tm (case, title-case and digit indicators. Version 2 adds prefixes, suffixes, word shape and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 697 Tm (one-token context. Version 3 adds multi-length affixes, normalised shape, orthographic flags) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 683 Tm (and context within two tokens, with adjusted L1/L2 regularisation. A CRF scores an entire) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 669 Tm (label sequence, so learned transitions encourage valid BIO patterns.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 650 Tm (5.2 BiLSTM family) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 624 Tm (The baseline PyTorch BiLSTM learns word embeddings from scratch and encodes left and right) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 610 Tm (context before token-wise classification. The BiLSTM-CRF replaces independent softmax) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 596 Tm (decisions with learned transition scores and Viterbi decoding, using validation-based early) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 582 Tm (stopping and weight decay. The GloVe variant initialises a 300-dimensional embedding table) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 568 Tm (from glove-wiki-gigaword-300, uses case-aware lowercase fallback and extends the vocabulary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 554 Tm (for improved OOV coverage. The combined GloVe-BiLSTM-CRF incorporates both pretrained) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 540 Tm (lexical knowledge and structured decoding.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 521 Tm (5.3 DistilBERT) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 495 Tm (distilbert-base-cased was fine-tuned for token classification. Word labels are aligned to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 481 Tm (WordPiece tokens: the first subtoken receives the word label and later subtokens are ignored) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 467 Tm (in the loss with -100. Contextual embeddings can distinguish uses such as Apple the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 453 Tm (organisation from apples the fruit, while subwords reduce the impact of unseen spellings.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.35 g 1 0 0 1 278 25 Tm (5 / 10) Tj ET

