BT /F2 19 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 785 Tm (8. Conclusions) Tj ET
0.25 0.45 0.65 RG 50 766 m 545 766 l S
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 751 Tm (The experiments confirm that a carefully engineered CRF is a strong NER baseline. Richer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 737 Tm (local context and morphology produced the best comparable test score without requiring a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 723 Tm (GPU. Deep learning removes manual feature design, but a from-scratch BiLSTM needs explicit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 709 Tm (safeguards against OOV collapse, overfitting and invalid output transitions. GloVe and a CRF) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 695 Tm (head target these weaknesses separately and combine naturally. DistilBERT offers the most) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 681 Tm (expressive contextual representation, but its result here is limited by fallback training) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 667 Tm (and incomplete exported weights.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 648 Tm (Future work should train all neural systems under one full-GPU protocol, retain every final) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 634 Tm (checkpoint, tune CRF regularisation by validation search, report macro and entity-level F1) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 620 Tm (with seqeval, and analyse rare labels separately. These changes would improve both) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 606 Tm (scientific comparability and reproducibility.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.35 g 1 0 0 1 278 25 Tm (8 / 10) Tj ET

endstream
